{"_id":"8Nf64gfY7g5RhNSX","name":"Bandit Archer","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:bandit-archer","level":2,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":5,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":10,"movementSpeed":"12","fortitude":"3 (10)","willpower":"4 (11)","source":"Monstrous Lore p. 217","description":"These bandits carry weapons and attack merchants and travelers. If they go out in the wilds, they are called thugs or bandits; if they go out on the sea, they are pirates. This data represents those who use bows as weapons among them.\n\nThey are the lowest level in a large organization, but they may operate in groups of three to five people. Such small groups mainly target those with low protection and are unlikely to challenge strong or numerous enemies.\n\nThis data can also be used to represent lower level soldiers or villagers who use a bow.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Bow","accuracy":"4 (11)","damage":"2d+1","evasion":"0 (7)","defense":3,"hp":{"value":17,"max":17},"mp":{"value":12,"max":12}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Bow","description":"An attack with a Bow is treated as a Shooting Attack with &quot;Range: 2 (30m)&quot;."},{"title":"◯ Targeting","description":"Stray shots cannot occur."},{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"7 - 9","loot":"Bag of Silver (50G)"},{"roll":"10+","loot":"Bag of Silver (50G) x 1d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Bandit Archer","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"8QfwxpYgshHhdzQ5","name":"Alchemist Scholar","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:alchemist-scholar","level":8,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect, Magitech","habitat":"Various","reputation":11,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":14,"movementSpeed":"16","fortitude":"11 (18)","willpower":"11 (18)","source":"CR III p. 428","description":"This is a warrior that is proficient in the Alchemist class. It uses a variety of Evocations as well as weapon attacks. They are not as skilled as a warrior but can use both attacks and support depending on the actions of those they are working with.\n\nThe color of the material cards obtained as loot is randomly determined if necessary.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"11 (18)","damage":"2d+10","evasion":"10 (17)","defense":8,"hp":{"value":65,"max":65},"mp":{"value":18,"max":18}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► ⏩ Evocations/10 (17)","description":"It can use [ Vorpal Weapon ], [ Critical Ray ], [ Barkmail ], [ Paralyzing Mist ], [ Heal Spray ], [ Poison Needle ], and [ Manadown ] evocations. All Evocations are used at A rank. There is no limit to the number of cards; Alchemist Scholar can use as many cards as needed.\nWhen used with a Major Action, the Evocation check is performed with the standard value, success value, described in the heading of this ability; when used with a Minor Action, the success value is treated as 0."},{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides and adding +1 to it."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"Always","loot":"Alchemy Kit (100G)"},{"roll":"Always","loot":"A Rank Material Card (100G) x 2d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Alchemist Scholar","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"AlqTmIZE4iSM7WfA","name":"Strong Heavy Warrior","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:strong-heavy-warrior","level":6,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":9,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":11,"movementSpeed":"14","fortitude":"9 (16)","willpower":"8 (15)","source":"KF","description":"This is a warrior armed with a huge two-handed weapon and metal chains. They are not interested in anything other than attack, and they use their armor to stop any damage to themselves.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"8 (15)","damage":"2d+11","evasion":"7 (14)","defense":8,"hp":{"value":48,"max":48},"mp":{"value":14,"max":14}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"🗨 Cleave I","description":"It can attack up to 3 characters with melee attacks that can be reached, but the damage will be reduced by -3."},{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides and adding +1."},{"title":"⏩ △ Techniques","description":"They may use the [ Beetleskin ] and [ Bear Muscle ] Techniques."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"7+","loot":"Gem (150G/Gold A) x 1d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Strong Heavy Warrior","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity"