{"_id":"DtQhRg0P9hWEBL9e","name":"Heavy Shielded Guard","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:heavy-shielded-guard","level":11,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common","habitat":"Various","reputation":14,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":16,"movementSpeed":"15","fortitude":"15 (22)","willpower":"13 (20)","source":"CR II p. 411","description":"This is a heavy warrior armed with a large shield and metal armor, a one- handed weapon. They are knights who protect important Humanoid strongholds, such as royal castles and customs posts.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"14 (21)","damage":"2d+15","evasion":"13 (20)","defense":15,"hp":{"value":90,"max":90},"mp":{"value":15,"max":15}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ 🗨 △ Bodyguard Knowledge","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Block ] and [ Cover II ]."},{"title":"🗨 Power Strike II","description":"They can deal an additional 12 damage on their next attack. However, any Evasion Check made by them this turn receives a -2 penalty."},{"title":"⏩ △ Techniques","description":"They may use the [ Cat's Eyes ], [ Beetleskin ], and [ Bear Muscle ] Techniques."},{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides and adding +2 to it."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"Always","loot":"Well-Kept Large Shield (4,000G/Black White S)"},{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"7+","loot":"Bag of Silver (300G) x 2d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Heavy Shielded Guard","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"ro