{"_id":"EeIXINTfhd7YKiZd","name":"Lone Kick Master","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:lone-kick-master","level":9,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":12,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":16,"movementSpeed":"18","fortitude":"12 (19)","willpower":"11 (18)","source":"Monstrous Lore p. 221","description":"This is a martial artist who has been training to master the secrets of kicking techniques. They have won much respect for their kicks by striking vital points with their ever-changing kicks.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Kick","accuracy":"12 (19)","damage":"2d+13","evasion":"12 (19)","defense":6,"hp":{"value":76,"max":76},"mp":{"value":32,"max":32}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Double Attack","description":"It can attack the same target twice in one action with its Kick."},{"title":"◯ Leg Kick","description":""},{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides and adding +1 to it."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Bag of Silver (100G) x 2d"},{"roll":"7 - 10","loot":"Gem (300G/Gold A) x 1d"},{"roll":"11+","loot":"Gem (300G/Gold A) x 2d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Lone Kick Master","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation