{"_id":"R3hO5NxF3JEzYT71","name":"Biker Robber","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:biker-robber","level":4,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect (Dorden), Magitech","habitat":"Various","reputation":7,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":9,"movementSpeed":"30 (Bike)","fortitude":"6 (13)","willpower":"6 (13)","source":"Natural History of Dorden p. 133","description":"This villain rides a motorcycle across grasslands and attacks magical trains. They have mastered Magitech and also use gun attacks, but since it's impossible to shoot while riding the bike, they sometimes swing the gun like a blunt weapon to strike during movement.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Gun (Rider)","accuracy":"6 (13)","damage":"2d+2","evasion":"5 (12)","defense":4,"hp":{"value":24,"max":24},"mp":{"value":24,"max":24}},{"style":"Slam (Bike)","accuracy":"7 (14)","damage":"2d+6","evasion":"7 (14)","defense":5,"hp":{"value":40,"max":40},"mp":{"value":0,"max":0}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"All Sections","description":""},{"title":"◯Dismounting","description":"This monster's Rider section is mounted on the Bike section. If the Rider is dismounted, all sections suffer a -1 penalty on all Skill Checks and have their damage reduced by -1 point.\nSee the Rider class and the Riding Rules for rules (CR III, p. 84) for this monster on how to dismount and remount. If not mounted, this monster's Speed becomes &quot;12.&quot;"},{"title":"Rider","description":""},{"title":"► Magitech 3 Level / Magic Power 5 (12)","description":""},{"title":"►Gunfire / 6 (13) / Evasion / Negates","description":"The Gun has &quot;Range: 1 (10m)&quot; and a max magazine of 3."},{"title":"◯Targeting","description":"When using a Ranged Attack or casting magic or effects with &quot;Area: [| Shot]],&quot; it does not cause stray shots."},{"title":"◯Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, the Rider may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."},{"title":"Bike","description":""},{"title":"◯Mechanical Body","description":"It is immune to criticals from edged weapons."},{"title":"◯All-Terrain Vehicle","description":"Bike can ignore up to -2 modifiers due to poor footing."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 7","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"8 - 10","loot":"Bag of Silver (30G)"},{"roll":"11+","loot":"Magisphere (100G)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Biker Robber","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"RW8zFvdqDizWTZYO","name":"Artificer Sniper","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:artificer-sniper","level":12,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect, Magitech","habitat":"Various","reputation":15,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":19,"movementSpeed":"16/-","fortitude":"15 (22)","willpower":"15 (22)","source":"BM","description":"A high level marksman and Magitech user, with enough skill and attack power to slay foes with a preemptive strike. In combat, they prefer to split away from their allies and strike down their opponents from hidden vantage position.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"16 (23)","damage":"2d+15","evasion":"14 (21)","defense":5,"hp":{"value":85,"max":85},"mp":{"value":76,"max":76}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."},{"title":"► Magitech 10 Level/Magic Power 14 (21)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magic/Gunfire Aptitude","description":"Knows [ Targeting ], [ Magic Convergence ], [ Magic Control ], and [ Hawk Eye ] Combat Feats."},{"title":"► Gunfire / 16 (23) / Evasion / Negates","description":"Performs a Ranged Attack using a gun with the following data (Name, req. Strength, etc. are omitted).\nStance | Max Magazine | Accuracy | C Value | Addl. Damage | Range |\n2H | 2 | – | 10 | +4 | 2 (60m) |"}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"Always","loot":"Magisphere (Large) (500G/-)"},{"roll":"2 - 5","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"6 - 8","loot":"Bag of Silver (300G/-) x2d"},{"roll":"9 - 12","loot":"Bag of Silver (400G/-) x2d"},{"roll":"13+","loot":"Customized Weapon (5000G/Black White S)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Artificer Sniper","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"S5fg8v0lOQOmdsPx","name":"Bandit Leader","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:bandit-leader","level":4,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":7,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":12,"movementSpeed":"14","fortitude":"6 (13)","willpower":"5 (12)","source":"CR III p. 428","description":"This is a leader of bandits. They always have three to five men or priests with them. They fight with their weapons on the frontlines.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"6 (13)","damage":"2d+7","evasion":"6 (13)","defense":4,"hp":{"value":30,"max":30},"mp":{"value":15,"max":15}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"🗨 Power Strike I","description":"They can deal an additional +4 damage on their next attack. However, any Evasion Check made by them this turn receives a -2 penalty."},{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"7 - 10","loot":"Bag of Silver (50G) x 1d"},{"roll":"11+","loot":"Bag of Silver (50G) x 2d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Bandit Leader","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity