{"_id":"TBAtLpTuslKXxlgC","name":"Support-Specialized Magic Archer","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:support-specialized-magic-archer","level":3,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect, Arcana, Sylvan","habitat":"Various","reputation":6,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":10,"movementSpeed":"16","fortitude":"5 (12)","willpower":"5 (12)","source":"School of Wizardry Eusiz (SW2.5 supplement), p. 114","description":"A Humanoid who has learned multiple magic disciplines along with the art of archery. They are highly versatile and can play an important role in any situation.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Bow","accuracy":"5 (12)","damage":"2d+3","evasion":"0 (7)","defense":3,"hp":{"value":21,"max":21},"mp":{"value":27,"max":27}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."},{"title":"◯🗨Magical Aptitude","description":"The archer has learned the Combat Feats [ Targeting ] and [ Metamagic/Targets ]."},{"title":"►Magic (2 Systems) Level 2 / Magic Power 4 (11)","description":"Mastered any two of the following: Truespeech Magic , Spiritualism Magic , Divine Magic , Fairy Magic , or Summoning Arts up to Level 2.\nFairy Magic types are normally Water/Ice, Fire, Wind, and Light, though the GM may change these as they see fit."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 8","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"9+","loot":"Bag of Silver (50G) x 1d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Support-Specialized Magic Archer","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"l