{"_id":"VAe3aA6n8THora1v","name":"Fairy Swordsman Expert","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:fairy-swordsman-expert","level":9,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Sylvan","habitat":"Various","reputation":12,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":15,"movementSpeed":"18","fortitude":"11 (18)","willpower":"12 (19)","source":"CR II p. 411","description":"This is a magic warrior who is skilled in Fairy Magic. Rather than using Fairy Magic themself, they prefer to attack with [Mana Strike] while summoning fairies and letting them cast spells.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"12 (19)","damage":"2d+11","evasion":"11 (18)","defense":7,"hp":{"value":59,"max":59},"mp":{"value":50,"max":50}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Fairy Magic 9 Level/Magic Power 12 (19)","description":"It can use Earth, Water/Ice, Fire, and Wind types."},{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ] and [ Metamagic/Targets ]."},{"title":"🗨 Mana Strike = +12 damage","description":"May deal an additional +12 damage to their next melee attack. At risk, they take a -2 penalty to their Fortitude and Willpower checks."},{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides and adding +1 to it."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"Always","loot":"Fairy Tamer's Gem (125G) x 4"},{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"7 - 10","loot":"Bag of Silver (200G) x 2d"},{"roll":"11+","loot":"Bag of Silver (300G) x 2d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Fairy Swordsman Expert","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"t