{"_id":"XcwElBhPW2DcyvJZ","name":"Novice Dark Hunter","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:novice-dark-hunter","level":2,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":5,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":9,"movementSpeed":"16","fortitude":"4(11)","willpower":"3(10)","source":"AB, p. 127","description":"This is a Humanoid who has mastered the Dark Hunter class and has just begun activities as an adventurer. Though lacking in durability and attack power when fighting alone, they possess abilities that can fulfill the role of a mobile striker when fighting alongside other characters.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"4(11)","damage":"2d+2","evasion":"&#32;","defense":4,"hp":{"value":3,"max":3},"mp":{"value":32,"max":32}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯Thrown Attack","description":"Weapon attacks can also be treated as thrown attacks with &quot;Range/Area: 1 (10m) / Shot .&quot;"},{"title":"⏩Silver Thread","description":"Retrieves the weapon used in the throwing attack back to hand. Consumes 2 HP before the throwing attack. If this action is not taken, this monster loses the weapon and damage is reduced by 4 points thereafter (minimum 0)."},{"title":"◯Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"Always","loot":"Weapon (30G/Black White B) x 1d"},{"roll":"2 - 10","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"11+","loot":"Bag of Silver (50G/-)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Novice Dark Hunter","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"ZzzPkIBypjJ8vUAt","name":"Black-Clad Archer","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:black-clad-archer","level":3,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect, Learned Magic Language","habitat":"Various","reputation":6,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":12,"movementSpeed":"13/-","fortitude":"4 (11)","willpower":"5 (12)","source":"GR, Battle Mastery p. 152","description":"A Humanoid archer who prefers black clothing in order to fade into the shadows of the night. They have some experience in combat and are quite threatening when firing from the rearguard. If precautions are not taken, adventurers could find themselves facing unexpected difficulties in dealing with them.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Bow","accuracy":"5 (12)","damage":"2d+4","evasion":"4 (11)","defense":2,"hp":{"value":21,"max":21},"mp":{"value":12,"max":12}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."},{"title":"◯ Bow","description":"Attacks with a Bow are treated as Ranged Attacks with Range 2 (30m)."},{"title":"◯ Targeting","description":"Stray shots cannot occur."},{"title":"⏩ Technique","description":"Can use the Techniques [ Cat's Eyes ] and [ Bear Muscle ]."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"7 - 11","loot":"Bag of Silver (100G/-) x 1d"},{"roll":"12+","loot":"Gem (150G/Gold A) x 1d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Black-Clad Archer","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"abR0oeuUbq99Wjmn","name":"Energetic Battle Dancer","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:energetic-battle-dancer","level":5,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":8,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":15,"movementSpeed":"20","fortitude":"8(15)","willpower":"7(13)","source":"AB, p. 128","description":"This is a Humanoid who has gained experience as a Battle Dancer and defeated many enemies. They fight using active Combat Feats and Techniques that they employ, depending on the situation.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"8(15)","damage":"2d+7","evasion":"&#32;","defense":8,"hp":{"value":2,"max":2},"mp":{"value":32,"max":32}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"🗨Repeated Strike I","description":"Can make two Accuracy checks; if one hits, the damage is dealt once."},{"title":"🗨Cleave I","description":"It can attack up to 3 characters with melee attacks that can be reached, but the damage will be reduced by -3. If more than one is hit, the damage is determined individually."},{"title":"⏩△Techniques","description":"They may use the [ Cat's Eyes ], [ Bear Muscle ], and [ Gazelle Feet ] Techniques."},{"title":"◯Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"High-quality Weapon (150G/Black White A)"},{"roll":"7+","loot":"Engraved Weapon (600G/Black White A)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Energetic Battle Dancer","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":fal