{"_id":"ev62lwl7gs5LBdMp","name":"Skilled Dark Hunter","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:skilled-dark-hunter","level":8,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":11,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":16,"movementSpeed":"18/-","fortitude":"11(18)","willpower":"11(18)","source":"AB, p. 128","description":"This is a Dark Hunter who attacks using mental power. While they have high HP, they get tired quickly since HP is consumed with each thrown attack, making them unsuitable for prolonged battles.\n\nWhen combined with allies or abilities that can restore HP, they can demonstrate terrifying power.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"11(18)","damage":"2d+11","evasion":"&#32;","defense":10,"hp":{"value":5,"max":5},"mp":{"value":32,"max":32}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯Mental Throw","description":"Weapon attacks are treated as thrown weapon attacks with &quot;Range: 2 (20m).&quot; When performing a thrown attack, Skilled Dark Hunter consumes 1d HP before making an Accuracy check."},{"title":"⏩Silver Thread","description":"Retrieves the weapon used in the throwing attack back to hand. Consumes 2 HP before the throwing attack. If this action is not taken, this monster loses the weapon and damage is reduced by 4 points thereafter (minimum 0)."},{"title":"⏩Take Aim","description":"For 30 seconds (3 rounds), gain a +1 bonus to Accuracy checks for thrown attacks and [►Penetrating Throw] success values. Using this effect consumes 1d HP."},{"title":"►Penetrating Throw / 10 (17) / Evasion / Negates","description":"When performing a [◯Mental Throw], it can be executed as &quot;Range/Area: 2 (20m) / Line .&quot; Skilled Dark Hunter consumes an additional 1d HP (total 2d points) before making the thrown attack."},{"title":"◯Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides and adding +1 to it."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 10","loot":"Engraved Weapon (600G/Black White A)"},{"roll":"11+","loot":"Well-Kept Weapon (1,000G/Black White S)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Skilled Dark Hunter","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"fPMToZY3QWpRvEjU","name":"Armed Merchant","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:armed-merchant","level":1,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":4,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":8,"movementSpeed":"11/-","fortitude":"3 (10)","willpower":"2 (9)","source":"GR, Battle Mastery p. 152","description":"An arms-bearing merchant. They have learned a number of self-defense techniques to use against opponents, and make use of their wits to protect themselves when in danger.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"3 (10)","damage":"2d+1","evasion":"2 (9)","defense":2,"hp":{"value":13,"max":13},"mp":{"value":10,"max":10}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."},{"title":"► Barricade","description":"Places an improvised obstacle in front of the merchant to hide for 10 seconds (1 round), granting +4 Defense, and rendering them unable to be targeted by ranged attacks or magic from a different area (Simplified Combat) or from a distance of 10m or greater (Standard/Advanced Combat). This improvised obstacle is treated as a Wooden Fence (thickness: 2cm) (see CR III, p. 122)\nThis ability can only be used once."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 5","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"6 - 9","loot":"Bag of Silver (30G/-)"},{"roll":"10+","loot":"Bag of Silver (50G/-)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Armed Merchant","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"jFub3gGrTcJgkg83","name":"Evil Priest","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:evil-priest","level":7,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Daemonic","habitat":"Various","reputation":10,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":13,"movementSpeed":"14","fortitude":"9 (16)","willpower":"10 (17)","source":"CR II p. 410","description":"This priest believes in an evil god associated with the Second Sword. They are enemies of Humanoid society in various ways, such as those who sneak into Humanoid cities and try to propagate their religion and those who work in partnership with the Barbarous clans.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"8 (15)","damage":"2d+6","evasion":"8 (15)","defense":5,"hp":{"value":53,"max":53},"mp":{"value":44,"max":44}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Divine Magic 7 Level/Magic Power 10 (17)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Hawk Eye ], and [ Metamagic/Targets ]."},{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides and adding +1."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 12","loot":"Holy Symbol of the Evil God (600G/Black White A)"},{"roll":"13+","loot":"Strange Holy Symbol (3,300G/White S)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Evil Priest","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"jpWpSchgobGIFdRp","name":"Evil Bishop","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:evil-bishop","level":13,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five Senses","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":16,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":17,"movementSpeed":"18/-","fortitude":"15 (22)","willpower":"17 (24)","source":"BM","description":"A priest that serves as the head of a large temple. Although they are Humanoid, they follow the teachings of the gods of the Second Sword and lead Barbarous and others of the same faith to invade Humanoid lands.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"14 (21)","damage":"2d+8","evasion":"15 (22)","defense":12,"hp":{"value":92,"max":92},"mp":{"value":87,"max":87}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."},{"title":"► Divine Magic 13 Level/Magic Power 17 (24)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 ► Magic Aptitude","description":"The Bishop can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Magic Convergence ], [ Magic Control ], [ Hawk Eye ], [ Universal Metamagic ], [ Double Cast ] and [ Wordbreak ]."},{"title":"◯ Multiple Declarations = 2 times","description":""}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"Always","loot":"Strange Holy Symbol (3,300G / White S)"},{"roll":"2 - 8","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"9+","loot":"Large Gem (400G / Gold S)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Evil Bishop","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"