{"_id":"o5M4DR1Cay4s4Yps","name":"Heretic Priest","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:heretic-priest","level":10,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect, Arcana","habitat":"Various","reputation":13,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":7,"movementSpeed":"12","fortitude":"12 (19)","willpower":"14 (21)","source":"CR III p. 429","description":"This is a priest who is not accepted by the Humanoid community and has turned to the worship of Barbarous gods associated with the Second Sword. While hiding their true identity, they work as a spy for Barbarous.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Staff","accuracy":"10 (17)","damage":"2d+5","evasion":"8 (15)","defense":11,"hp":{"value":65,"max":65},"mp":{"value":74,"max":74}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Divine Magic 10 Level/Magic Power 15 (22)","description":""},{"title":"► Spiritualism Magic 7 Level/Magic Power 12 (19)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 ► Magic Aptitude","description":"A Heretic Priest can use the Combat Feats [ Universal Metamagic ], [ Targeting ], [ Hawk Eye ] and [ Wordbreak ]."},{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides and adding +1 to it."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"Always","loot":"Bag of Silver (100G) x 2d"},{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"7 - 12","loot":"Bag of Silver (200G) x 2d"},{"roll":"13+","loot":"Large Gem (4,000G/Gold S)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Heretic Priest","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"oXQdDaM54It1B2AU","name":"Vengeance-Obsessed Dark Hunter","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:vengeance-obsessed-dark-hunter","level":7,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various, Shallow Abysses","reputation":10,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":15,"movementSpeed":"16/-","fortitude":"10 (17)","willpower":"10 (17)","source":"Natural History of Ursyla p. 135","description":"This Dark Hunter lost their sanity after being consumed by the battle against Daemons.\n\nThey live only to defeat Daemons, but at some point, they become unable to trust others, believing everyone to be Daemon's agents. As a result, they may get into fights over trivial matters or suddenly attack others.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"10 (17)","damage":"2d+6","evasion":"10 (17)","defense":5,"hp":{"value":54,"max":54},"mp":{"value":18,"max":18}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"►Spirit-Controlled Thrown Weapon / 10 (17) / Evasion / Negates","description":"When using this effect, consume 8 HP. Perform a thrown attack with a large weapon at &quot;Range/Area: 2(20m) / Shot &quot;, dealing &quot;2d+13&quot; points of physical damage to &quot;Target: 1 Character&quot; (the thrown weapon automatically returns to this monster's hand)."},{"title":"◯ Targeting","description":"The [►Spirit-Controlled Thrown Weapon] does not cause stray shots."},{"title":"⏩Take Aim","description":"Using this effect consumes 16 HP. For 30 seconds (3 rounds), gain a +1 bonus to the Success Value of [►Spirit-Controlled Thrown Weapon]."},{"title":"►Consume Healing Potion","description":"Recover 2d+6 HP points."},{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides and adding +1."},{"title":"◯ Delicate Loot","description":"The quantity of loot Healing Potion +1 is reduced by the number of times this monster used [►Consume Healing Potion] during battle (minimum 0)."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"Always","loot":"Healing Potion +1 (100G/-) x 1d"},{"roll":"2 - 9","loot":"Keen Weapon (100G/Black White A)"},{"roll":"10+","loot":"Well-Kept Weapon (1,000G/Black White S)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Vengeance-Obsessed Dark Hunter","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"rgW22T4kGJf3RVR7","name":"Magic Student","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:magic-student","level":2,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect, Arcana, Sylvan","habitat":"Various","reputation":5,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":7,"movementSpeed":"12","fortitude":"3 (10)","willpower":"4 (11)","source":"School of Wizardry Eusiz (SW2.5 supplement), p. 114","description":"A Humanoid who practices magic. This entry can also be used as sample data for low-level adventuring mages.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Staff","accuracy":"2 (9)","damage":"2d","evasion":"2 (9)","defense":4,"hp":{"value":14,"max":14},"mp":{"value":18,"max":18}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."},{"title":"◯🗨Magical Aptitude","description":"The student has learned the Combat Feat [ Targeting ]."},{"title":"►Magic (1 System) Level 2 / Magic Power 4 (11)","description":"The student has mastered one of the following: Truespeech Magic , Spiritualism Magic , Divine Magic , Fairy Magic , or Summoning Arts up to Level 2.\nFairy Magic types are normally Water/Ice, Fire, Wind, and Light, though the GM may change these as they see fit."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 8","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"9+","loot":"Bag of Silver (30G) x 1d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Magic Student","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"up4jOLzzFB41Dybh","name":"Swift Blade","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:swift-blade","level":3,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":6,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":11,"movementSpeed":"16","fortitude":"5 (12)","willpower":"4 (11)","source":"VC","description":"This is a Humanoid agile warrior. It is not only a melee attacker, but also can throw knives and quickly moves, leading the battle to an advantageous situation.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"5 (12)","damage":"2d+3","evasion":"5 (12)","defense":3,"hp":{"value":22,"max":22},"mp":{"value":14,"max":14}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Throw Knife/4 (11)/Evasion/Negates","description":"Throws a knife. This unique skill deals 1d+1 physical damage to &quot;Target: 1 Character&quot; at &quot;Range: 1 (10m)&quot;.\nThis effect may be used up to twice per combat."},{"title":"◯ Killing Blow","description":"If the 2d roll determining damage is 9 or more, the damage is increased by +4 points."},{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"7 - 10","loot":"Weapon (30G/Black White B)"},{"roll":"11+","loot":"High-quality Weapon (150G/Black White A)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Swift Blade","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"wOC7QqHZhVdhSkg2","name":"Promising Magician","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:promising-magician","level":4,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect, Arcana, Sylvan","habitat":"Various","reputation":7,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":7,"movementSpeed":"10","fortitude":"5(12)","willpower":"7(14)","source":"AB, p. 127","description":"This is a relatively young Humanoid magician. They are talented in magic and can wield multiple types of magical systems. They are also financially well-off and work alongside law enforcement, traveling to various locations to put their magic to good use, utilizing the results for investigation and research.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"0(7)","damage":"2d-2","evasion":"&#32;","defense":0,"hp":{"value":4,"max":4},"mp":{"value":32,"max":32}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"►Magic (2 Systems) 3 Level / Magic Power 6 (13)","description":"Choose any two magic systems to learn at Level 3. The types commonly used in Fairy Magic are Fire, Water/Ice, Wind, and Light, but the GM can modify these four types or adopt the contract rules (see MA, p. 136).\nWhen using Abyssal Magic, enhancing effects can only be used 1 round."},{"title":"◯🗨Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use Combat Feats [ Targeting ] and [ Metamagic/Targets ]."},{"title":"◯Mako Stones","description":"Possesses 3 Mako Stones with 3 MP remaining each, which can be used when consuming MP.\nAny Mako Stones that remain unused when this character's HP falls below 0 can be automatically acquired during Loot Determination. These Mako Stones cannot be targeted by [ Mass Looting ]."},{"title":"◯Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"Always","loot":"Remaining Mako Stones"},{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"7 - 10","loot":"Bag of Silver (100G/-)"},{"roll":"11+","loot":"Bag of Silver (100G/-) x 1d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Promising Magician","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"wRG4NldgHcAVyE30","name":"Skilled Assassin","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:skilled-assassin","level":6,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":9,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":13,"movementSpeed":"18/-","fortitude":"9 (16)","willpower":"8 (15)","source":"GR, Battle Mastery p. 154","description":"Humanoids who have fulfilled enough assassination contracts for their abilities to have grown to the point where they can be called &quot;skilled.&quot; Their strikes, while risky, are more powerful than that of an average warrior, and the danger of their chosen victim being struck down with a single blow is real.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"9 (16)","damage":"2d+8","evasion":"8 (15)","defense":6,"hp":{"value":43,"max":43},"mp":{"value":15,"max":15}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."},{"title":"🗨 Desperate Strike I","description":"Add +5 damage to a successful Weapon attack. At the same time, the Skilled Assassin receives 5 points of fixed damage to HP.\nIf the attack is not successful, the Assassin does not receive any fixed damage."},{"title":"⏩ △ Techniques","description":"The Skilled Assassin can use the [ Cat's Eyes ], [ Gazelle Feet ] and [ Bear Muscle ] Techniques."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"7 - 11","loot":"Bag of Silver (100G/-) x 1d"},{"roll":"12+","loot":"Gems (150G/Gold A) x 1d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Skilled Assassin","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"xdpk7Mucl8PFnXaR","name":"Sorcerer","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:sorcerer","level":6,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect, Learned Magic Language","habitat":"Various","reputation":9,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":12,"movementSpeed":"14/-","fortitude":"7 (14)","willpower":"9 (16)","source":"BM","description":"A Humanoid who has achieved moderate skill as a magician. Their abilities outside of their magic are not a threat, but as long as they have MP and Mako Stones, they can use powerful magic to eliminate enemies and support allies. The GM should decide on their specific magic type in advance. If this monster appears in solo play, it should be treated as having learned Truespeech Magic , unless otherwise specified.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Weapon","accuracy":"5 (12)","damage":"2d+3","evasion":"5 (12)","defense":5,"hp":{"value":34,"max":34},"mp":{"value":39,"max":39}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."},{"title":"► Magic (1 System) Level 6/Magic Power 9 (16)","description":"The Wizard has mastered one of the following: Truespeech Magic , Spiritualism Magic , Fairy Magic , Magitech , Nature Magic or Summoning Arts up to Level 6."},{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magical Aptitude","description":"The Sorcerer has learned the [ Targeting ], [ Metamagic/Targets ] and [ Cheat Cast I ] Combat Feats."},{"title":"◯ Mako Stone","description":"The Sorcerer possesses 3 Mako Stones with 5 MP remaining each, which can be consumed when using skills or transferred to other characters.\nMako Stones that are not consumed before the Sorcerer's HP falls below 0 are automatically acquired when determining loot."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"Always","loot":"Remaining Mako Stones (See Above)"},{"roll":"2 - 3","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"4 - 7","loot":"Bag of Silver (50G/-) x1d"},{"roll":"8 - 11","loot":"Bag of Silver (100G/-) x 1d"},{"roll":"12","loot":"Gems (300G/Gold A) x 1d"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Sorcerer","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"ysnekPMOXsykfZCM","name":"Scarred","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:scarred","level":4,"monsterType":"Humanoid","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":1,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional Dialect","habitat":"Various","reputation":7,"weakness":0,"weakPoint":"None","initiative":10,"movementSpeed":"14","fortitude":"6 (13)","willpower":"6 (13)","source":"KF","description":"This is the result of the downfall of an adventurer who died and was successfully resuscitated. They have a strong sense of inferiority due to the &quot;scar&quot; they carry on their body and in their soul, and hold an unreasonable grudge against novice adventurers and ordinary people.","combatStyles":[{"style":"Fist","accuracy":"7 (14)","damage":"2d+4","evasion":"6 (13)","defense":3,"hp":{"value":35,"max":35},"mp":{"value":12,"max":12}}],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Sword's Grace/Change Fate","description":"Once per day, they may choose to change the result of a Skill Check or Damage roll, by switching the faces of the rolled 2d to the opposite sides."},{"title":"► Double Attack","description":"It can attack the same target twice in one action with its Fists."},{"title":"► Throw Attack/6 (13)/Evasion/Negates","description":"Throws 1 character as a melee attack. Target takes 2d+2 physical damage and falls prone."}],"lootTable":[{"roll":"2 - 6","loot":"Nothing"},{"roll":"7 - 9","loot":"Bag of Silver (30G)"},{"roll":"10+","loot":"Gem (150G/Gold A)"}]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Scarred","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}